607
00:19:58,720 --> 00:20:00,600
Such an optimist.

608
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:02,200
True.

609
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:05,800
You're happy every day.

610
00:20:07,360 --> 00:20:08,400
How could I not be?

611
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:09,880
I'm so happy every day.

612
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:12,240
You two are always together.

613
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:14,000
How could you not be?

614
00:20:30,450 --> 00:20:33,170
♪Morning steam rises
