♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

626
00:20:59,370 --> 00:21:02,330
♪Just be a little braver♪

627
00:21:02,330 --> 00:21:03,570
♪Keep moving♪

628
00:21:03,690 --> 00:21:05,170
